cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "webpic — WebGPU plasma-physics data visualizer"
abstract: >-
  A browser-native 3D visualizer and lightweight analyzer for plasma
  simulation output from PIC and MHD codes. Volume raymarching,
  orthogonal slices, and GPU field-line tracing run on WebGPU with no
  install; data is read from pypic-blessed formats (Zarr v3) under the
  same canonical field schema, so the browser view and the Python
  analysis agree by construction.
type: software
